Mansa uses external wireless and Bluetooth projects/specifications for
behavioral reference only. No Aircrack-ng, BlueZ, Wireshark, Kismet, or other
security-tool source is copied into this repository. The built-in candidate
list is small and authored in Mansa; it does not bundle SecLists or another
external wordlist. The embedded OUI/vendor table is a limited lookup whose
source and redistribution provenance still need to be recorded.
